# Room Hire Booking App

A static prototype for scheduling room hire bookings with a visual grid that keeps every reservation visible. Rooms run across
 the top of the timeline, times run down the side from 08:00 to 20:00, and each booking block displays the time and company n
ame.

## Features

- Pop-up booking form with clash detection, room setup dropdown, and catering notes that appear when selected.
- Day selector with a “Today” shortcut so you can review and switch between schedules quickly.
- Calendar grid that spans longer bookings across their full duration while keeping a persistent activity log underneath.
- Responsive red-themed UI that works in both light and dark mode.

## Getting started

Open `index.html` in a browser. Launch the “New booking” button to add a reservation. The prototype stores data only in your b
rowser session—there is no shared database or backend service.
